  {
   "id": "ground-zero-hero-281603@major-2026-08-28",
   "gameId": "ground-zero-hero-281603",
   "displayName": "Ground Zero Hero Update: Patching Up the Wasteland",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-28T23:47:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey all you wonderfully freakish Radlings!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "GZH has officially been out for a week now, and it's been awesome seeing your excitement, encouragement, and support. Thank you for playing, sharing your experiences, giving us your thoughts, and helping us figure out where we can improve.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We wanted to get an update out to take care of a few immediate items that could use some love, based on our own observations and your feedback. We'll keep reviewing bug reports and comments as they come in, so please keep sharing your thoughts with us here on Steam, on Discord, or across our other socials.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We're pushing out an update today. Here's what's changing",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Fixed an issue for Chinese language users where a giant DODGE label could get stuck on screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Quitting to desktop or the title screen now saves any caps collected during a run.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed an issue where some Mutations might not save correctly when saving mid-run.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Improved reliability of Steam Achievements unlocking correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "• Additional performance optimizations, with more to come.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Over the next few weeks, we'll bring this update to all platforms. We've got more fixes in the works too, so keep the feedback coming. We're listening, taking notes, and making GZH better for you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "and if you haven't already don't forget to...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Download Ground Zero Hero Today! [dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2570580/Ground_Zero_Hero\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
